0,"desc":"普攻\n进行至多5段的连续攻击，造成气动伤害。\n \n重击\n消耗耐力进行突刺攻击，造成气动伤害。\n \n重击·凌空击\n若在重击期间按住普攻，会在重击结束后施放凌空击，造成气动伤害。\n \n重击·潜渊斩\n若在重击期间松开普攻，会在重击结束后施放潜渊斩，造成气动伤害。\n \n空中攻击\n消耗耐力进行空中下落攻击，造成气动伤害。\n在下落攻击后一定时间内短按普攻，将会追击目标，造成气动伤害。\n \n空中攻击·长空不坠\n施放重击凌空击或在空中施放共鸣技能枪扫风定一定时间内，可以进行浮空攻击，造成气动伤害。\n \n闪避反击\n成功闪避后一定时间内短按普攻，将会攻击目标，造成气动伤害。","descEn":"Basic Attack\nPerform up to 5 consecutive attacks, dealing Aero DMG.\n \nHeavy Attack\nConsume Stamina to thrust forward, dealing Aero DMG.\n \nHeavy Attack: Windborne Strike\nHold Basic Attack during Heavy Attack to cast Windborne Strike after Heavy Attack ends, dealing Aero DMG.\n \nHeavy Attack: Abyssal Slash\nRelease Basic Attack during Heavy Attack to cast Abyssal Slash after Heavy Attack ends, dealing Aero DMG.\n \nMid-Air Attack\nConsume Stamina to perform a Plunging Attack while in mid-air, dealing Aero DMG.\nAfter performing the Plunging Attack, use Basic Attack to perform a follow-up attack, dealing Aero DMG.\n \nMid-Air Attack: Banner of Triumph\nAfter casting Heavy Attack Windborne Strike or Resonance Skill Windqueller in mid-air, Jiyan can perform a mid-air attack, dealing Aero DMG.\n \nDodge Counter\nUse Basic Attack after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing Aero DMG.","params":[{"label":"第一段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 1 DMG","values":["36.80%","39.81%","42.83%","47.05%","50.07%","53.54%","58.37%","63.20%","68.03%","73.16%"]},{"label":"第二段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 2 DMG","values":["22.00%","23.80%","25.60%","28.13%","29.93%","32.01%","34.89%","37.78%","40.67%","43.73%"]},{"label":"第三段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 3 DMG","values":["18.30%*5","19.80%*5","21.30%*5","23.40%*5","24.90%*5","26.62%*5","29.02%*5","31.43%*5","33.83%*5","36.38%*5"]},{"label":"第四段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 4 DMG","values":["33.30%*2","36.03%*2","38.76%*2","42.58%*2","45.31%*2","48.45%*2","52.82%*2","57.19%*2","61.56%*2","66.20%*2"]},{"label":"第五段伤害","labelEn":"Stage 5 DMG","values":["11.87%*7+77.18%*2","12.84%*7+83.51%*2","13.82%*7+89.84%*2","15.18%*7+98.70%*2","16.15%*7+105.03